<title>BELARUS: Belarus rouble unchanged at 21,000 to dlr in Minsk.</title>
<headline>Belarus rouble unchanged at 21,000 to dlr in Minsk.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belarussian rouble was unchanged at 21,000 per dollar on the Minsk Interbank Currency Exchange.</p>
<p>				    January 30	    January 29</p>
<p> Belar rouble rate to dollar   21,000		  21,000</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $0.792 million	    $2.675 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
